---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{% set prefix = "/en" if lang == "en" else "" %}
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-dark" style="--hero-image: url('/images/web/factory-building.jpg')">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="{{ prefix }}/">{% if lang == "en" %}Home{% else %}首页{% endif %}</a><span>/</span><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Company{% else %}公司与基地{% endif %}</span></nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">TEAMSTAR / QUNXIN INDUSTRIAL</span>
      <h1>{% if lang == "en" %}Zhangzhou manufacturing backed by group experience.{% else %}以集团经验承接漳州制造。{% endif %}</h1>
      <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Qunxin Industrial was established in Zhangzhou in 2024 under the Wei Qun industrial group, continuing its industrial knife and cutting-tool manufacturing background.{% else %}群新工业于 2024 年在福建漳州成立，承接伟群工业集团在工业刀具与切削工具领域的制造背景。{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-grid">
      <div class="content-block"><span class="eyebrow">COMPANY TIMELINE</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}A manufacturing path extended to Zhangzhou.{% else %}制造脉络，延伸至漳州。{% endif %}</h2><div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-row"><div class="timeline-year">40+</div><div><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Group cutting-tool background{% else %}集团工业刀具背景{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Industry experience originating from the Taiwan group business.{% else %}源自台湾集团业务的工业刀具行业经验。{% endif %}</p></div></div>
        <div class="timeline-row"><div class="timeline-year">1990</div><div><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Shenzhen production base established{% else %}深圳生产基地成立{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Expanded the group manufacturing system in mainland China.{% else %}拓展集团在中国大陆的制造体系。{% endif %}</p></div></div>
        <div class="timeline-row"><div class="timeline-year">2024</div><div><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Qunxin Industrial established in Zhangzhou{% else %}漳州群新工业成立{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Focused on industrial machine knives, manufacturing and sales support.{% else %}面向工业机械刀具制造与销售服务。{% endif %}</p></div></div>
        <div class="timeline-row"><div class="timeline-year">ISO</div><div><h3>ISO 9001:2015</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Quality management system certification.{% else %}质量管理体系认证。{% endif %}</p></div></div>
      </div></div>
      <aside><div class="notice">{% if lang == "en" %}Manufacturing and inspection routes are reviewed against the blade family, drawing and batch requirement for each project.{% else %}针对不同刀具类别、图纸和批量需求，团队提供相应的制造与检测路线说明。{% endif %}</div></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% include "partials/rfq-cta.njk" %}
</main>
